{"id":1759,"bodyHtml":"<div><div><p>2026年6月1日下午，中北大学2026年NUBA篮球赛在东区篮球场落下帷幕，环境与安全工程学院代表队奋勇拼搏，男子篮队斩获季军、女子篮球队拿下亚军，再创赛事佳绩。</p><p>赛场上，男篮队员们默契配合、敢打敢拼，女篮姑娘们不畏强手、全力以赴。他们以汗水诠释热爱，用拼搏书写荣耀，在多轮激烈角逐中一路过关斩将，双双取得优异成绩 。</p><p>此次比赛不仅锤炼了团队意志，更凝聚了学院力量。环境与安全工程学院将继续发扬团结拼搏精神，激励学子在赛场与学业中不断奋进，绽放青春光彩 。全体队员以汗水践行拼搏精神，充分展现环安学子锐意进取、奋勇争先的青春风采。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=FLRT9fL7L4nRWkLAzffM4N8o7VfU8L1YLm9PMmCYU4C8UzN0gihFp2hmCIa0LkyinSyiM1ysL7U4LmVkoRGbnmvZnR74Mzf7Uz-iUmQ7nRMFM8-iL4n7LRAFMz-4MR-Jqjfjo4OeoDA/_IVPgDTJQty0LzGsMYyPLz-ZM1bw62m8c&oid=1384835319&tid=1077&nid=11286&e=.jpg\" vspace=\"0\" hspace=\"0\" alt=\"\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/05E5670D321B809F78D1350DA25B6DD3/7B534D08/52342\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 500px\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=FnzC9bMRLYMl7aUAmTko7-8M4LsU8V1koRlbM47Yo77YLRU0gihFp2hmCIa0UShfnkyYnkhkLll4n7-4LR-bL4laMmG8oRVfU4-bL7LDolMFL4rRMzLbnRWFLz78oR7ZgtXaQ4Oeo4xwqjTAvShXptQ0g47aM4v0Lz7YoRCJqdmnx&oid=1384835319&tid=1077&nid=11286&e=.jpg\"></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=FL4L94UmnVU8UaMA49ZL7WfL4TfLR91DM7CYM4-YozUPnzN0gihFp2hmCIa0nSy8nky4nSyDU4rfnRM7M4N8nlQ7nlnRnRV2LmCbU4vsU8VFozCDU494MRTFMmn7MlUJqjfjo4OeoDA/_IVPgDTJQty0LzGsMYyPLz-ZM1bw62m8c&oid=1384835319&tid=1077&nid=11286&e=.jpg\" vspace=\"0\" hspace=\"0\" alt=\"\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/E4D3E6C5AD3D794EFDEDCD1F269C77CA/966C8349/64D5D\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 500px\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=FM7U9inzM7M7MfUA4VRMRN4LmG8Ml71PUlVVnzlsn7VkLlC0gihFp2hmCIa0nkybL1yDLkyaoRTRM4CsLmvsMmW2M8UaU4CsUm7YLlUYLmrFoRM7M47iMNrFnlLPU4GJqjfjo4OeoDA/_IVPgDTJQty0LzGsMYyPLz-ZM1bw62m8c&oid=1384835319&tid=1077&nid=11286&e=.jpg\"></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=FLzV9fLl7PnNlZMARQ7M8lanRCsnz-1bMmCDLz6kMlnfnz70gihFp2hmCIa0MkyZU1yiUYyZnmGsUlWkMzr2MzG8UNLDnzLDL4VfUlQRMzTFMRGaUmWkLlWFLNnVnRUJqjfjo4OeoDA/_IVPgDTJQty0LzGsMYyPLz-ZM1bw62m8c&oid=1384835319&tid=1077&nid=11286&e=.jpg\" vspace=\"0\" hspace=\"0\" alt=\"\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/48B5C8F07ABB55F504BC6E3631A